{
  "id": "the-simpsons---6x12---homer-the-great",
  "title": "The Simpsons - 6x12 - Homer the Great",
  "sourceFilename": "The Simpsons - 6x12 - Homer the Great.en.srt",
  "importedAt": "2026-09-19T20:06:04.628Z",
  "lineCount": 286,
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "Homer the Great",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 2940,
      "endMs": 4349
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "Looks like you got a leak. Could you start fixing it?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 35523,
      "endMs": 38074
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "The basement is getting awfully flooded. And I think the cat's down there.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 38242,
      "endMs": 42839
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "Yeah, I probably won't be able to get the parts I need for two, three weeks.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 43477,
      "endMs": 47537
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "And that's if I order them today.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 47738,
      "endMs": 49685
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "Which I won't. Oh, dear.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 49886,
      "endMs": 53040
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "Emergency call. Gotta go.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 55255,
      "endMs": 56899
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "What should we do until you get back? Put a pan down there.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 57101,
      "endMs": 61128
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "It didn't work.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 65624,
      "endMs": 66899
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "Lousy traffic jams.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 70188,
      "endMs": 72503
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "The traffic report will get me out of this one.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 72705,
      "endMs": 75523
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "This is Ernie Pie.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 75893,
      "endMs": 77537
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "We got a little accident that's backing traffic up as far as this reporter can see.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 77738,
      "endMs": 82604
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "Hi, Dad.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 91564,
      "endMs": 93242
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "Hey, how come you guys got such great parking places?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 99852,
      "endMs": 103443
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "It's a secret. Shut up.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 103644,
      "endMs": 106329
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "text": "All right, Econo-Save, you just made the list.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 114752,
      "endMs": 117906
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "text": "Hey, will you guys help me fix my...?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 122604,
      "endMs": 124785
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "text": "Hey, how come you guys got better chairs than me?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 126463,
      "endMs": 130255
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "text": "It's a secret. Shut up.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 130456,
      "endMs": 133040
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "text": "Hey, you guys wanna go bowling tonight?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 138879,
      "endMs": 140658
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "text": "No, we're busy. Yeah, we got things to do.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 140859,
      "endMs": 143376
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "text": "Like what?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 143577,
      "endMs": 145289
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "text": "It's a secret.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 145490,
      "endMs": 147537
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "text": "Shut up.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 147872,
      "endMs": 149785
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "text": "So Lenny and Carl are never around on Wednesdays.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 151631,
      "endMs": 153946
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "text": "They don't tell me where they go. It's like a conspiracy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 154114,
      "endMs": 156765
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "text": "A conspiracy, eh? You think they're involved in the Kennedy assassination?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 156933,
      "endMs": 160859
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "text": "I do now.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 161060,
      "endMs": 163376
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "text": "I'm gonna follow them tonight and see where they go.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 163611,
      "endMs": 166128
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "text": "Oh, Homer, don't start stalking people again. It's so illegal.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 166329,
      "endMs": 170456
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "text": "You stalked Charles Kuralt because you thought he dug up your garden.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 170624,
      "endMs": 173846
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "text": "Well, something did. I don't want you stalking anyone.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 174047,
      "endMs": 177403
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "text": "Oh, okay. Have it your own way, Marge.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 177570,
      "endMs": 179987
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "text": "I'll be back in a minute.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 180188,
      "endMs": 181832
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "text": "I'm going outside...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 182034,
      "endMs": 185020
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "text": "...to stalk...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 185221,
      "endMs": 187671
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "text": "...Lenny and Carl...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 187872,
      "endMs": 190691
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "text": "All I have to do is follow the yellow-drip road.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 207067,
      "endMs": 210154
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "text": "There's our secret meeting place. Yes. Let's go inside.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 217530,
      "endMs": 220349
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "text": "Sounds good.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 220483,
      "endMs": 222329
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "text": "I can see everything and they're none the wiser.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 236255,
      "endMs": 239644
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "text": "An intruder! He will pay the ultimate price.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 249409,
      "endMs": 251859
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "text": "Yes, the ultimate price.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 252060,
      "endMs": 254510
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "text": "Get out of here!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 254711,
      "endMs": 257396
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "text": "I saw weird stuff in that place last night.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 260013,
      "endMs": 262362
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "text": "Weird, strange, sick, twisted, eerie, godless, evil stuff. And I want in.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 262564,
      "endMs": 267396
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "text": "We don't know what you're talking about, Homer.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 267597,
      "endMs": 269745
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "text": "You can't join the Stonecutters. It's too exclusive.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 269913,
      "endMs": 272396
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "text": "Oh, well.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 272564,
      "endMs": 274007
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "text": "That was a real nice secret organization we had once.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 274208,
      "endMs": 276792
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "text": "Stonecutters, eh? How do I join?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 276993,
      "endMs": 278638
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "text": "There are two ways to gain membership:",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 278839,
      "endMs": 280617
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "text": "Be the son of a Stonecutter. Next.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 280819,
      "endMs": 282832
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "text": "Or save the life of a Stonecutter.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 283034,
      "endMs": 284846
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "text": "Hey!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 285047,
      "endMs": 286423
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "text": "I saved your life. That egg sandwich could've killed you by cholesterol.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 287060,
      "endMs": 291054
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "text": "Forget it, Homer. While it has been established eggs contain cholesterol...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 291255,
      "endMs": 294711
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "text": "...it has not been proven that they raise the level...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 294879,
      "endMs": 297564
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "text": "...of serum cholesterol in the human bloodstream.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 297765,
      "endMs": 300081
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "text": "Those Egg Council creeps got to you too?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 300315,
      "endMs": 302262
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "text": "Oh, you got it all wrong, Homer. It's not like that.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 302497,
      "endMs": 306221
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "text": "You'd better run, egg!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 307597,
      "endMs": 309342
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "text": "Why don't people like me, Marge?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 309611,
      "endMs": 311523
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "text": "Everyone likes you. You're a wonderful person.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 311758,
      "endMs": 314477
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "text": "Why don't those stupid idiots let me in their crappy club for jerks?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 314678,
      "endMs": 317664
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "text": "I'm sure it's nothing personal, Homer. It is.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 317866,
      "endMs": 320282
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "text": "It's been happening to me all my life.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 320483,
      "endMs": 323000
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "text": "Hey, Billy, hey, Joey, come on in. There's plenty of room.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 325315,
      "endMs": 328940
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "text": "Sorry. Not you, Homer. Why not?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 329141,
      "endMs": 331893
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "text": "But you let in Homer Glumpet.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 334443,
      "endMs": 336456
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "text": "It says \"no Homers.\"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 336658,
      "endMs": 339577
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "text": "We're allowed to have one.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 339779,
      "endMs": 341188
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "text": "I felt so left out.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 342765,
      "endMs": 345148
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "text": "Kids can be so cruel. We can? Thanks, Mom.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 345383,
      "endMs": 349745
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "text": "Cut it out, Bart!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 350047,
      "endMs": 352329
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "text": "I'd give anything to get into the Stonecutters.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 353933,
      "endMs": 356181
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "text": "What do they do there, Dad? I'm a member.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 356383,
      "endMs": 358530
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "text": "What do they do? What don't they do?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 358732,
      "endMs": 361315
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "text": "Oh, they do so many things, they never stop.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 361517,
      "endMs": 363832
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "text": "Oh, the things they do there. My stars. You don't know what they do, do you?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 364034,
      "endMs": 367993
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "text": "Not as such, no. I'm a Stonecutter.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 368195,
      "endMs": 370107
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "text": "Remember those self-hypnosis classes we took to help us ignore Grampa?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 370342,
      "endMs": 373866
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "text": "Do I ever. It's five years later and I still think I'm a chicken.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 374067,
      "endMs": 377087
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "text": "I'm a chicken, Marge. I know, I know.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 377289,
      "endMs": 379436
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "text": "Maybe we should be listening to him now.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 379638,
      "endMs": 381450
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "text": "I'm a member!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 381651,
      "endMs": 383396
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "text": "What? What?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 383564,
      "endMs": 385242
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "text": "You're a member of the Stonecutters, Grampa?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 385376,
      "endMs": 387389
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "text": "Oh, sure. Let's see.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 387591,
      "endMs": 389772
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "text": "I'm an Elk, a Mason, a Communist.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 389973,
      "endMs": 392993
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "text": "I'm the president of the Gay & Lesbian Alliance, for some reason.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 393195,
      "endMs": 397020
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "text": "Here it is. The Stonecutters.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 397221,
      "endMs": 400242
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "text": "This is it. My ticket in.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 400443,
      "endMs": 402020
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "text": "They have to let me join if I'm the son of a member.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 402221,
      "endMs": 404638
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "text": "I'll take this Communist one too.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 404839,
      "endMs": 407154
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "text": "Coming through. Can't throw me out. My father's a member.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 407926,
      "endMs": 410879
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "text": "I'm in, I'm in. Okay, okay, Homer, you're in.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 411081,
      "endMs": 413463
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "text": "Just don't point that thing at me.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 413664,
      "endMs": 415275
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "text": "Thanks, Lenny. When am I gonna be initiated?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 415477,
      "endMs": 418463
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "text": "As soon as Number One gets here. Number One?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 418664,
      "endMs": 421987
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "text": "What kind of stupid wiener name is that?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 422188,
      "endMs": 424839
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "text": "\"Hello, my name is Number One.\"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 425040,
      "endMs": 429436
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "text": "And so forth.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 429872,
      "endMs": 431383
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "text": "We call each other by number.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 431584,
      "endMs": 432993
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "text": "Carl is Number 14, I'm Number 12. Burnsie is Number 29.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 433161,
      "endMs": 436215
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "text": "You outrank Mr. Burns here? Sure. Watch.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 436416,
      "endMs": 438732
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "text": "Hey, 29, get over here!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 438933,
      "endMs": 441651
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "text": "Thank you, sir. May I have another?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 444772,
      "endMs": 446718
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "text": "Patience, Monty. Climb the ladder.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 449537,
      "endMs": 452456
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "text": "Is he the leader? Of this chapter.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 454403,
      "endMs": 456584
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "text": "There are chapters all over the world. And it has been foretold...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 456752,
      "endMs": 459805
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "text": "...that someday a Chosen One will...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 459973,
      "endMs": 461819
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "text": "Okay, okay. I didn't ask for your life story.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 462020,
      "endMs": 464403
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "text": "Let the initiation begin.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 467524,
      "endMs": 469940
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "text": "All Stonecutters must take the Leap of Faith.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 470141,
      "endMs": 473161
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "text": "If you survive this five-story plunge, your character will be proven.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 473362,
      "endMs": 478161
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "text": "Happy landings!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 479470,
      "endMs": 480745
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "text": "I think I have to do it again. My blindfold came off.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 492792,
      "endMs": 496685
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "text": "This ritual is called Crossing the Desert.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 498456,
      "endMs": 501745
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "text": "And this we call the Unblinking Eye.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 503826,
      "endMs": 507550
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "text": "Hey, have you ever noticed that the Crossing the Desert...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 509933,
      "endMs": 512584
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "text": "...is a lot like the Unblinking Eye?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 512785,
      "endMs": 514430
    },
    {
      "index": 123,
      "text": "And exactly like the Wreck of the Hesperus.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 514597,
      "endMs": 516779
    },
    {
      "index": 124,
      "text": "And now the final ordeal: The Paddling of the Swollen Ass, with paddles.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 516980,
      "endMs": 522617
    },
    {
      "index": 125,
      "text": "And by the sacred parchment, I swear that if I reveal the secrets...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 526107,
      "endMs": 530067
    },
    {
      "index": 126,
      "text": "...of the Stonecutters, may my stomach become bloated...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 530268,
      "endMs": 532852
    },
    {
      "index": 127,
      "text": "...and my head be plucked of all but three hairs.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 533054,
      "endMs": 536409
    },
    {
      "index": 128,
      "text": "He should have to take a different oath.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 536644,
      "endMs": 538389
    },
    {
      "index": 129,
      "text": "Everyone takes the same oath.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 538591,
      "endMs": 540336
    },
    {
      "index": 130,
      "text": "Welcome to the club, Number 908.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 540537,
      "endMs": 542987
    },
    {
      "index": 131,
      "text": "You have joined the Sacred Order of the Stonecutters...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 543188,
      "endMs": 545805
    },
    {
      "index": 132,
      "text": "...who since ancient times have split the rocks of ignorance...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 546007,
      "endMs": 548960
    },
    {
      "index": 133,
      "text": "...that obscure the light of knowledge and truth.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 549128,
      "endMs": 551678
    },
    {
      "index": 134,
      "text": "Now let's all get drunk and play Ping-Pong.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 551879,
      "endMs": 554228
    },
    {
      "index": 135,
      "text": "He's already kind of heavy, you know, and...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 555638,
      "endMs": 557685
    },
    {
      "index": 136,
      "text": "Well, to be honest, I never got around to ordering that part for you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 559672,
      "endMs": 563297
    },
    {
      "index": 137,
      "text": "So it's still gonna be a couple of weeks.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 563498,
      "endMs": 565881
    },
    {
      "index": 138,
      "text": "Oh, really? Yes.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 566082,
      "endMs": 568901
    },
    {
      "index": 139,
      "text": "Really? Yes. Yes.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 569102,
      "endMs": 571719
    },
    {
      "index": 140,
      "text": "But what if I were to shake your hand in this way?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 571921,
      "endMs": 575646
    },
    {
      "index": 141,
      "text": "Well, I didn't realize you were a member.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 579605,
      "endMs": 581686
    },
    {
      "index": 142,
      "text": "So long, suckers.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 589639,
      "endMs": 591149
    },
    {
      "index": 143,
      "text": "Same old space, huh, Dad? Yep.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 603162,
      "endMs": 605176
    },
    {
      "index": 144,
      "text": "But they gave me these Rollerblades so I can glide to the front door.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 605344,
      "endMs": 610679
    },
    {
      "index": 145,
      "text": "Sweet.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 614236,
      "endMs": 615511
    },
    {
      "index": 146,
      "text": "Jealous? Well, no. We've got the same chair.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 618330,
      "endMs": 621686
    },
    {
      "index": 147,
      "text": "You're jealous.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 621887,
      "endMs": 623297
    },
    {
      "index": 148,
      "text": "Your membership pack. What's this?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 623867,
      "endMs": 626585
    },
    {
      "index": 149,
      "text": "You put that on your car so you won't get any tickets.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 626787,
      "endMs": 629236
    },
    {
      "index": 150,
      "text": "This keeps paramedics from stealing your wallet.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 629471,
      "endMs": 631787
    },
    {
      "index": 151,
      "text": "Oh, and don't bother calling 911 anymore. Here's the real number.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 631988,
      "endMs": 635579
    },
    {
      "index": 152,
      "text": "Homer, a man who called himself \"you know who\"...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 638612,
      "endMs": 641464
    },
    {
      "index": 153,
      "text": "...just invited you to a secret \"wink-wink\" at the \"you know what.\"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 641632,
      "endMs": 645021
    },
    {
      "index": 154,
      "text": "Sure are popular now that you're a Stonecutter.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 645189,
      "endMs": 647438
    },
    {
      "index": 155,
      "text": "Oh, yeah. Beer busts, beer blasts, keggers, stein hoist...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 647605,
      "endMs": 652605
    },
    {
      "index": 156,
      "text": "...AA meetings, beer night.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 652773,
      "endMs": 654585
    },
    {
      "index": 157,
      "text": "It's wonderful, Marge. I've never felt so accepted in all my life.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 654753,
      "endMs": 659518
    },
    {
      "index": 158,
      "text": "These people look deep within my soul...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 659686,
      "endMs": 661934
    },
    {
      "index": 159,
      "text": "...and assign me a number based on the order in which I joined.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 662102,
      "endMs": 666733
    },
    {
      "index": 160,
      "text": "Who controls the British crown? Who keeps the metric system down?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 671162,
      "endMs": 674954
    },
    {
      "index": 161,
      "text": "We do We do Who leaves Atlantis off the maps? Who keeps the Martians under wraps?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 675122,
      "endMs": 683243
    },
    {
      "index": 162,
      "text": "We do We do Who holds back the electric car?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 683411,
      "endMs": 691230
    },
    {
      "index": 163,
      "text": "Who makes Steve Guttenberg a star?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 691397,
      "endMs": 695458
    },
    {
      "index": 164,
      "text": "We do We do Who robs cavefish of their sight? Who rigs every Oscar night?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 695626,
      "endMs": 703579
    },
    {
      "index": 165,
      "text": "We do We do Thank you. Tonight we are here...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 703746,
      "endMs": 713478
    },
    {
      "index": 166,
      "text": "...to commemorate our glorious society's 1500th anniversary.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 713646,
      "endMs": 717303
    },
    {
      "index": 167,
      "text": "And in honor of this momentous occasion...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 717538,
      "endMs": 720256
    },
    {
      "index": 168,
      "text": "...we're having ribs. - Yeah!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 720424,
      "endMs": 723813
    },
    {
      "index": 169,
      "text": "I need a bib. If I slop any on my shirt, I could lose the respect of my brethren.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 725928,
      "endMs": 730357
    },
    {
      "index": 170,
      "text": "So let us rejoice and enjoy our meal...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 730525,
      "endMs": 732370
    },
    {
      "index": 171,
      "text": "...in the shadow of the hallowed sacred parchment.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 732538,
      "endMs": 737605
    },
    {
      "index": 172,
      "text": "Homer. Oh, yeah. Thanks, Lenny.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 739887,
      "endMs": 743881
    },
    {
      "index": 173,
      "text": "This is just appalling and outrageous.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 744317,
      "endMs": 746532
    },
    {
      "index": 174,
      "text": "What? Did I miss something?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 746733,
      "endMs": 748847
    },
    {
      "index": 175,
      "text": "Oh, God!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 750995,
      "endMs": 752270
    },
    {
      "index": 176,
      "text": "No, Homer, no! This is outrageous! You can't do that!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 752438,
      "endMs": 755089
    },
    {
      "index": 177,
      "text": "No! You really are stupid.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 755290,
      "endMs": 758142
    },
    {
      "index": 178,
      "text": "And the official Stonecutter underwear too.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 762370,
      "endMs": 765324
    },
    {
      "index": 179,
      "text": "Please don't kick me out. This society's everything to me.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 771934,
      "endMs": 774686
    },
    {
      "index": 180,
      "text": "Please give me another chance. I've learned my lesson!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 774854,
      "endMs": 777639
    },
    {
      "index": 181,
      "text": "I've learned my lesson!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 777807,
      "endMs": 780122
    },
    {
      "index": 182,
      "text": "That's it!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 781162,
      "endMs": 782807
    },
    {
      "index": 183,
      "text": "How can we punish him further? Oh, sorry.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 782975,
      "endMs": 785055
    },
    {
      "index": 184,
      "text": "Homer Simpson, for your continuing and baffling desecration...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 785923,
      "endMs": 790419
    },
    {
      "index": 185,
      "text": "...of our beloved sacred parchment...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 790587,
      "endMs": 792836
    },
    {
      "index": 186,
      "text": "...you are hereby banished from the Stonecutters forever.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 793003,
      "endMs": 796628
    },
    {
      "index": 187,
      "text": "And as a final humiliation, you must walk home naked...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 796795,
      "endMs": 801124
    },
    {
      "index": 188,
      "text": "...dragging behind you the Stone of Shame.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 801292,
      "endMs": 805117
    },
    {
      "index": 189,
      "text": "The mark!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 813742,
      "endMs": 815017
    },
    {
      "index": 190,
      "text": "Oh, that. It's just a birthmark. And I'll thank you not to stare.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 816493,
      "endMs": 819950
    },
    {
      "index": 191,
      "text": "He's the Chosen One.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 820151,
      "endMs": 822735
    },
    {
      "index": 192,
      "text": "You are the Chosen One...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 824413,
      "endMs": 826695
    },
    {
      "index": 193,
      "text": "...whom the sacred parchment prophesied would lead us to glory.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 826862,
      "endMs": 831292
    },
    {
      "index": 194,
      "text": "Now to the top of Mount Springfield for the coronation.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 831527,
      "endMs": 835487
    },
    {
      "index": 195,
      "text": "Remove the Stone of Shame.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 835654,
      "endMs": 838742
    },
    {
      "index": 196,
      "text": "Attach the Stone of Triumph!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 838943,
      "endMs": 842802
    },
    {
      "index": 197,
      "text": "Mental note: Don't overdo this.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 859245,
      "endMs": 860889
    },
    {
      "index": 198,
      "text": "Peekaboo!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 867500,
      "endMs": 868507
    },
    {
      "index": 199,
      "text": "I always wondered if there was a God.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 873339,
      "endMs": 875218
    },
    {
      "index": 200,
      "text": "And now I know. There is, and it's me.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 875386,
      "endMs": 878138
    },
    {
      "index": 201,
      "text": "You're not a god, Homer. Remember, Dad, all glory is fleeting.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 878305,
      "endMs": 882030
    },
    {
      "index": 202,
      "text": "So? Beware the Ides of March.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 882198,
      "endMs": 885017
    },
    {
      "index": 203,
      "text": "No. I know you're happy now...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 885185,
      "endMs": 886795
    },
    {
      "index": 204,
      "text": "...but it won't last forever. - Everything lasts forever.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 886963,
      "endMs": 889681
    },
    {
      "index": 205,
      "text": "Getting what you want all the time will leave you unfulfilled and joyless.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 889849,
      "endMs": 894077
    },
    {
      "index": 206,
      "text": "Remove the girl.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 894245,
      "endMs": 895520
    },
    {
      "index": 207,
      "text": "You're not with your Stonecutters. There are no lackeys around to carry out your...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 895722,
      "endMs": 900117
    },
    {
      "index": 208,
      "text": "Another strike for the Chosen One!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 907366,
      "endMs": 909211
    },
    {
      "index": 209,
      "text": "Hurrah!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 909379,
      "endMs": 911292
    },
    {
      "index": 210,
      "text": "That's just an excellent break.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 918380,
      "endMs": 919815
    },
    {
      "index": 211,
      "text": "Oh, most assuredly. Absolutely.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 919982,
      "endMs": 922518
    },
    {
      "index": 212,
      "text": "I'm out. No, no, no. Homer...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 930025,
      "endMs": 931860
    },
    {
      "index": 213,
      "text": "...you have a royal sampler.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 932027,
      "endMs": 934997
    },
    {
      "index": 214,
      "text": "Oh, I win again, don't I?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 935164,
      "endMs": 938167
    },
    {
      "index": 215,
      "text": "Good one. Nice hand, Chosen One.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 938567,
      "endMs": 940936
    },
    {
      "index": 216,
      "text": "You know, I think you guys are letting me win.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 941136,
      "endMs": 943338
    },
    {
      "index": 217,
      "text": "No! No! No!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 943505,
      "endMs": 946975
    },
    {
      "index": 218,
      "text": "From now on I want you to be honest with me.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 947142,
      "endMs": 949478
    },
    {
      "index": 219,
      "text": "I mean, I'm not perfect, right?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 949645,
      "endMs": 951446
    },
    {
      "index": 220,
      "text": "Yeah. Well...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 953782,
      "endMs": 956752
    },
    {
      "index": 221,
      "text": "Run.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 960923,
      "endMs": 962558
    },
    {
      "index": 222,
      "text": "The grand exalted leader requests a moment of your time.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 970096,
      "endMs": 972765
    },
    {
      "index": 223,
      "text": "Class dismissed.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 973333,
      "endMs": 975401
    },
    {
      "index": 224,
      "text": "Lisa, you were right. My happiness is fading.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 978938,
      "endMs": 981941
    },
    {
      "index": 225,
      "text": "You're experiencing spiritual emptiness because your power has isolated you...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 982108,
      "endMs": 985745
    },
    {
      "index": 226,
      "text": "...from other human beings. - What do you mean, isolated?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 985912,
      "endMs": 989549
    },
    {
      "index": 227,
      "text": "Well, maybe you could reach out to the community and help other people.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 991351,
      "endMs": 995355
    },
    {
      "index": 228,
      "text": "I could help others.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 995855,
      "endMs": 998358
    },
    {
      "index": 229,
      "text": "I'll get a bunch of monkeys, dress them up and make them reenact the Civil War.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 998558,
      "endMs": 1003830
    },
    {
      "index": 230,
      "text": "Dad, that doesn't help people.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1003997,
      "endMs": 1005598
    },
    {
      "index": 231,
      "text": "Couldn't hurt. Unless the monkeys started hurting people.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1005765,
      "endMs": 1008968
    },
    {
      "index": 232,
      "text": "Which they almost certainly would.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1009135,
      "endMs": 1011571
    },
    {
      "index": 233,
      "text": "Brothers. Brothers!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1017242,
      "endMs": 1018677
    },
    {
      "index": 234,
      "text": "Brothers, I've learned a wonderful lesson.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1020679,
      "endMs": 1023982
    },
    {
      "index": 235,
      "text": "Helping others makes our own lives better and makes us better people.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1024182,
      "endMs": 1028687
    },
    {
      "index": 236,
      "text": "So instead of just shooting pool and drinking beer...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1028854,
      "endMs": 1031890
    },
    {
      "index": 237,
      "text": "...let us Stonecutters use what we have to help the less fortunate.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1032057,
      "endMs": 1036561
    },
    {
      "index": 238,
      "text": "He's gone mad with power, like that Albert Schweitzer guy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1040198,
      "endMs": 1043735
    },
    {
      "index": 239,
      "text": "Oh, for the love of God!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1054046,
      "endMs": 1056014
    },
    {
      "index": 240,
      "text": "Somebody get the Jaws of Life!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1056181,
      "endMs": 1057349
    },
    {
      "index": 241,
      "text": "Higher! Higher!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1061186,
      "endMs": 1064189
    },
    {
      "index": 242,
      "text": "Oh, I'll give you higher, my filthy little urchin.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1064356,
      "endMs": 1066825
    },
    {
      "index": 243,
      "text": "You've won this round.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1071863,
      "endMs": 1074433
    },
    {
      "index": 244,
      "text": "Oh, thank you, Mr. Simpson.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1081804,
      "endMs": 1084807
    },
    {
      "index": 245,
      "text": "It looks so much better.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1084974,
      "endMs": 1087210
    },
    {
      "index": 246,
      "text": "A beautiful sky blue.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1087376,
      "endMs": 1090313
    },
    {
      "index": 247,
      "text": "You were right, Lisa. I've never felt so spiritually fulfilled.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1092281,
      "endMs": 1096986
    },
    {
      "index": 248,
      "text": "And with my brothers the Stonecutters behind me...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1097186,
      "endMs": 1099922
    },
    {
      "index": 249,
      "text": "...this is the beginning of a better world for all of us.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1100089,
      "endMs": 1103860
    },
    {
      "index": 250,
      "text": "We gotta kill him! Take it easy, Moe.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1104093,
      "endMs": 1106229
    },
    {
      "index": 251,
      "text": "Let's hear from the Stonecutter World Council before we act too rashly.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1107192,
      "endMs": 1111264
    },
    {
      "index": 252,
      "text": "Kill him. Kill him.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1111431,
      "endMs": 1112799
    },
    {
      "index": 253,
      "text": "Kill the fool! Afraid I have to disagree...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1112999,
      "endMs": 1115268
    },
    {
      "index": 254,
      "text": "...with Orville, Jack and Mister. Can't we just do something to his voice box?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1115435,
      "endMs": 1120041
    },
    {
      "index": 255,
      "text": "We might as well face the truth.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1120241,
      "endMs": 1122076
    },
    {
      "index": 256,
      "text": "As long as we're Stonecutters, he will control our lives.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1122243,
      "endMs": 1125981
    },
    {
      "index": 257,
      "text": "Maybe. But maybe we don't wanna be Stonecutters no more.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1126148,
      "endMs": 1130419
    },
    {
      "index": 258,
      "text": "This is much better than the old Stonecutter hall.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1135859,
      "endMs": 1139363
    },
    {
      "index": 259,
      "text": "Silence. I now call to order the first meeting...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1140681,
      "endMs": 1143701
    },
    {
      "index": 260,
      "text": "...of the ancient, mystic society of...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1143869,
      "endMs": 1146856
    },
    {
      "index": 261,
      "text": "...No Homers.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1147024,
      "endMs": 1148299
    },
    {
      "index": 262,
      "text": "Hey, fellas. Can I join?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1151185,
      "endMs": 1153030
    },
    {
      "index": 263,
      "text": "Sorry. No Homers.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1153198,
      "endMs": 1156319
    },
    {
      "index": 264,
      "text": "Loyal Stonecutters...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1158131,
      "endMs": 1159775
    },
    {
      "index": 265,
      "text": "...let us begin our reenactment of the Battle of Gettysburg.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1159943,
      "endMs": 1163601
    },
    {
      "index": 266,
      "text": "Homer, you can't just keep hanging out with these Colobus monkeys.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1166185,
      "endMs": 1169675
    },
    {
      "index": 267,
      "text": "Somebody's gonna get parasites.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1169842,
      "endMs": 1172225
    },
    {
      "index": 268,
      "text": "Oh, Marge, kids, I miss my club.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1172426,
      "endMs": 1175782
    },
    {
      "index": 269,
      "text": "Oh, Homie.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1175950,
      "endMs": 1178634
    },
    {
      "index": 270,
      "text": "You know, you are a member of a very exclusive club.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1178802,
      "endMs": 1182829
    },
    {
      "index": 271,
      "text": "The Black Panthers? No, the family Simpson...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1182997,
      "endMs": 1186722
    },
    {
      "index": 272,
      "text": "...which has just five members.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1186923,
      "endMs": 1189205
    },
    {
      "index": 273,
      "text": "And only two of those members have special rings.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1190373,
      "endMs": 1194198
    },
    {
      "index": 274,
      "text": "Yeah! Yeah!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1194399,
      "endMs": 1196547
    },
    {
      "index": 275,
      "text": "I meant our wedding rings!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1197319,
      "endMs": 1199097
    },
    {
      "index": 276,
      "text": "You know, Marge, you're right.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1200876,
      "endMs": 1202755
    },
    {
      "index": 277,
      "text": "The Simpson family is the best possible club I could belong to.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1202923,
      "endMs": 1208460
    },
    {
      "index": 278,
      "text": "This club better be worth it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1213426,
      "endMs": 1216044
    },
    {
      "index": 279,
      "text": "All right, all right, it's Lisa's turn.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1216715,
      "endMs": 1219097
    },
    {
      "index": 280,
      "text": "Who controls the British crown? Who keeps the metric system down?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1229735,
      "endMs": 1233661
    },
    {
      "index": 281,
      "text": "We do We do Who keeps Atlantis off the maps? Who keeps the Martians under wraps?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1233829,
      "endMs": 1241916
    },
    {
      "index": 282,
      "text": "We do We do Who holds back the electric car?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1242084,
      "endMs": 1250104
    },
    {
      "index": 283,
      "text": "Who makes Steve Guttenberg a star?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1250272,
      "endMs": 1254232
    },
    {
      "index": 284,
      "text": "We do We do Who robs cavefish of their sight? Who rigs every Oscar night?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1254399,
      "endMs": 1262419
    },
    {
      "index": 285,
      "text": "We do We do Shut up. www.tvsubtitles.net",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1262587,
      "endMs": 2000
    }
  ],
